<title>USA: Property Capital sets $2/shr special div.</title>
<headline>Property Capital sets $2/shr special div.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property Capital Trust Friday said it declared a special dividend of $2 per share from the proceeds of the sale of properties.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on February 24 to holders of record n February 12.</p>
<p>The company also declared a regular dividend of $0.09 per share for the two months ended December 31, 1996. The dividend is also payable on February 24. The two month period reflects the firms move to a calendar fiscal year, from a fiscal year ending July 31.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610))</p>
</text>
